Comment: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:30.58,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.06,0:23:12.57,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:06.77,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:10.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We're going potato picking at the Nursery today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.45,0:00:11.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you see something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:16.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,According to the magazine at the convenience store,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:21.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,everyone dresses like this\Nwhen they work in the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:24.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you plan on digging up\Npotatoes with a bug catching net?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.87,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for taking care of us again this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:12.64,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Think nothing of it. Pick as many as you would like!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:14.53,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:15.87,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.87,0:02:18.67,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You carry the potatoes that you dig up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:21.28,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,So only dig up as many as you can carry, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:24.78,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, look it! They're connected!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:26.50,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Look how big it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:30.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is like treasure hunting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:33.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:36.42,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:37.33,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.33,0:02:38.86,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.11,0:02:42.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do... Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.92,0:02:45.62,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, your back is covered in dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:46.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:49.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who that could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:56.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's a little older than the\Nchildren at Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.49,0:02:59.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he lives here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.86,0:03:03.86,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, the lady's grandchild who lives\Nhere is already a high school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:05.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:08.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder where this child is from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:17.17,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:19.61,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Are you here by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:22.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Do you live nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.72,0:03:29.77,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.01,0:03:51.66,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. We didn't notice him in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:55.21,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right. These things happen once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:58.71,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he's one of the neighbor's children...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:02.95,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,All right then. It's about time we clean up and head back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:04.84,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.85,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You sure dug up a lot, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:09.06,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:11.73,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's so many potatoes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:14.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I tried my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:16.02,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.41,0:04:19.04,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I believe I said this when we first started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:21.40,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You carry what you dig up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:26.65,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess we're having baked potatoes when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:28.79,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:31.59,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, will you be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:33.45,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Should we help you carry some?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:40.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'll be okay! I can carry them all by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:44.47,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's impossible for you to carry\Nthat many by yourself. I'll help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:48.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's okay! The agreement was for you to carry all the potatoes that you dug up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:50.60,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's still such a bully...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:03.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's not possible... give it up, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:07.36,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Missy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:08.82,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,We'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:10.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:12.83,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.45,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Are they done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:21.39,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,There's so much smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:27.97,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Is it hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:32.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:34.18,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:36.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's hot so be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:40.40,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:45.57,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yum...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.69,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are we going to do about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Should I bake some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:56.33,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, let's share some with the neighbors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:06:03.00,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto? Could you take Kobato with you to those houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:05.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:07.08,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be faster that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:10.26,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But... Oh, together is just better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:15.50,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to get to know the neighbors better too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:17.52,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Is that okay with you, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:24.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll... do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:28.79,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me to help you. And don't be a hindrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:35.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,My potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:40.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He really is a bully. He\Nalways says I'm a hinderance...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But despite that, he never says don't come with me, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:49.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But he took my potatoes! I thought I was going to deliver them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:51.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You could see it as them being too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:54.56,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So he decided to do you a favor by carrying them for you, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.23,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:05.90,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We're from Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:10.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We went potato picking today, so we brought some over to share with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:13.75,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:19.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,These are from Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:22.02,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:24.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here are some potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:25.71,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:28.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They're from Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:32.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.65,0:07:37.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little more and we'll have\Ndelivered all the potatoes, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:38.74,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:42.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:48.48,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.46,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:53.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:54.95,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:58.70,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Little miss, it's been a while since I've seen you, hasn't it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:07:59.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:02.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Milk, have you been doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:07.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten a little bigger, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:08.25,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,He has, he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:10.84,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,He's been doing wonderfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:17.67,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:18.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.59,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,He was just walking by and\Nasked to borrow the water faucet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:24.31,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,He said he had just gone potato picking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:25.65,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.06,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:28.60,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hold this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:29.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:38.64,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me, you thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:43.62,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That's my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:44.87,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You potato thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:47.36,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:48.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:50.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:53.30,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Taking this thief to the police box.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:54.97,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,No! No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.08,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I'll return them! I'll return them, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:01.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, would you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:03.68,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Are you running away from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:05.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Running away from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.67,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:32.57,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing to say this time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:39.97,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:41.93,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Potato Thief is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:44.10,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a Potato Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:48.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You have your own name, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.15,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Keita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:09:56.70,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.07,0:10:00.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you run away from home, Keita?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:04.75,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to go back to my previous home...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Your... previous home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:13.17,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,The house we lived in before. Mom\Nchanged jobs, so we had to move...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.63,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,So how was your previous home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:21.93,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't gotten there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:23.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that where you're headed to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:29.52,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I really wanted to go, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:31.77,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You've forgotten where it is, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:33.82,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Have not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:37.36,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, your face clearly says that you've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:38.32,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,It does not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:42.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You wouldn't forget something like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:46.87,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I mean... when we moved,\NI was still in kindergarten...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:49.87,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I've just gotten a little confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:52.34,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That's called forgetting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:54.06,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't forgotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:10:58.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:58.34,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:02.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you can tell us what kind of house it was, we might be able to help you look for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:05.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Would you be able to draw a picture of your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:08.18,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:10.98,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Um, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:12.63,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:17.28,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,It had a red roof, and there were windows here and here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.28,0:11:20.52,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,And there was an antenna here... and also...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:23.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Draw what was around your house too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:26.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It'll make our search easier!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:32.89,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Um... there was a postbox here,\Nand next door, there was a dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:39.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What a big dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:42.12,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Every time I walked by, it would bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:45.89,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:11:58.11,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, and also!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.11,0:12:00.86,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Mom would always bake snacks for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:03.24,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:19.88,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,...read picture books to me, take me camping or to the amusement park when she had time off...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:23.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Keita?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:28.32,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I want to go back to that house!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:35.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:36.90,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:41.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I... want to help Keita find his house!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:54.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,With only a postbox and a dog as\Nleads, there's no way we could find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:58.33,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You don't remember anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:08.80,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:15.04,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Which way is it? Right? Left?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:18.95,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Um... this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.49,0:13:21.21,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Or no, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:40.80,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I know this spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.32,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I've been here before!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:43.78,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:45.61,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We might be close then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:48.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's great, isn't it, Keita?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:49.12,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.09,0:14:05.37,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:07.97,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,On second thought, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:09.95,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I need to save up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:11.53,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Save up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.87,0:14:14.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's a pretty complex term you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:18.41,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Cause Mom says it a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:19.64,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:20.75,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:21.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Those are...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.14,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Pears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.84,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You can tell just by looking, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:32.51,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:35.85,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Is this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:38.52,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We'll leave this in exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.63,0:14:45.06,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:48.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:52.45,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto has his good points too, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:54.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:56.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If he didn't that would be a problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.55,0:14:58.28,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Gimme a pear too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.44,0:15:04.53,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Delish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:12.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is the dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:18.43,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.55,0:15:21.44,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Next to this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:37.95,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,This... isn't my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:46.80,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We're going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:10.48,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:15.99,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,My room...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's locked, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.44,0:16:23.34,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I guess we have no choice then but to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:24.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:26.69,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.50,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Don't break it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:41.89,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to go back to the house you live in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:46.15,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Because... well, Grandpa's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.89,0:16:48.05,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:49.44,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.17,0:16:54.69,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Mom and I... we're living at Grandpa's house right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.69,0:16:59.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you dislike your Grandfather, Keita?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:01.46,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, he's a really big bully...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bully...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:05.83,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.03,0:17:08.03,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:12.64,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,In the morning, he always\Nyells at me really loudly to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:17.22,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Keita! You aren't up yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.01,0:17:19.49,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and tidy that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:23.89,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,At night, I want to watch just a little more TV...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:26.19,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,And play some more games!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:26.96,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:28.56,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:30.60,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:33.10,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,No staying up late! Hurry up and get to bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.21,0:17:38.44,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,And he always makes me eat the things I hate...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:40.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Things you hate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:43.50,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Like small fish and vegetables. {?? maybe there's a better term than small fish?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.37,0:17:45.27,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:50.02,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Don't play with your food! Eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.59,0:17:53.30,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is that... bullying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:56.31,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Grandpa hates me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:58.28,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,That's why he's always so strict with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:01.87,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,He thinks that it would be better if I just left!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:03.48,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I don't want to... go to that house...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.22,0:18:05.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Keita...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.24,0:18:11.79,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka also often tells the kids at the Nursery to eat fish and vegetables
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:14.40,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,because they're nutritious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:16.78,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Who's Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:24.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka is a kind teacher at Yomogi Nursery who loves all of the children there very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.00,0:18:26.70,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:40.96,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:48.50,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,If you're done with your bath, hurry up and go to bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:19:00.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bullying or not... it's hard to tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:04.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But if you look real closely, you might be able to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.21,0:19:06.42,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Keita.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:10.50,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Were you going to bake potatoes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:15.68,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Before, when we all baked potatoes together, it was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:20.92,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Take some responsibility and take some of these home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:21.76,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:25.05,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I apologized to the lady at the farm for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:29.78,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,She picked too many potatoes and now we don't know what to do with the leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:32.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That works out well for you, doesn't it, Keita?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:36.57,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:47.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Can you really get back all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:49.52,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:51.87,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:53.84,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:01.08,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:04.76,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:12.35,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.81,0:20:22.40,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:25.37,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:27.37,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.59,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:37.21,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.21,0:20:39.02,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:42.51,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make me worry like that, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:45.09,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Come, we're going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:48.51,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:55.21,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Your Mom's waiting at home for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.67,0:20:56.46,Default,Keita,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.09,0:21:03.49,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Keita is just about to get on the train with his Grandfather right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:06.11,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no need. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:11.54,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, you know Keita's home phone number?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:14.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Were you the one who called Keita's Grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:15.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.99,0:21:18.03,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:18.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:23.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Let's steam some potatoes when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:25.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:27.43,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:29.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:30.00,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:32.38,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:34.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:36.55,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Are you guys going home now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:38.92,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I've got something I need to do, so I'll be going ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:39.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:41.52,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Something to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:44.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We went potato picking with the Nursery today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:47.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And so we went to share the potatoes with the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.66,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:50.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto really is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:55.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,a nice guy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:22:01.72,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Kiyokazu's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.99,0:22:09.42,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I bet this one is from that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:14.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But Keita looked really sad looking at his old house...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:19.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But then he was able to\Nunderstand his Grandfather's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.31,0:22:22.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:25.38,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, Fujimoto also worked really hard today,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.06,0:22:28.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,so I'll split 100 between\Nthe two of you. 50 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.11,0:22:28.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.70,0:22:32.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But Fujimoto was a bully this morning, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:35.47,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose that's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:37.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, then taking that into\Naccount, Fujimoto gets a zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.21,0:22:40.88,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And you get a 70 for your efforts!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:44.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Erase the other one first\Nbefore writing a new score!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.55,0:22:46.52,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You've got a lot of complaints, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.52,0:22:48.76,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it should be 50 points for you after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:50.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Just erase the other one first!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:51.19,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Shush!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.19,0:22:52.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,25 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:53.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:54.52,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you still unsatisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.52,0:22:56.53,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then 12.5 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.53,0:22:59.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,My face is all black now...!
