Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:52.64,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs50\fnEmma Sophia\c&H16253C&\frz10.832\pos(239,409)}Keita Yoshimura
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:28.38,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnEmma Sophia\c&H303239&\move(363,335,363,446,0,2778)}Please take one.
