Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:38.58,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:43.17,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:47.18,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.41,0:00:49.98,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.25,0:00:57.32,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:02.90,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.74,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.91,0:01:10.28,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:13.34,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:16.08,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:21.33,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:24.14,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.15,0:01:27.73,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:30.49,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:33.23,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:40.11,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:44.12,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:48.77,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.97,0:00:38.58,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}How do I do this again?
